{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.[[cite:obs-5d4db4e1df75e6a23e11c0d9277b8fe665586c22 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe schedule specifies retention for ledgers as \"eleven calendar years\" followed by shredding.[[cite:obs-e6f7cbf2e4bb75cc2fde6b46c4effd5fa19e2106 \"Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"State the statute retention rule and the schedule duration with exact-source citations for each statement."}